-- Batch template: one card per row of cards.csv. Columns become $variables: $id, $name, $photo.
-- Run: gt batch examples/batch/template.gt examples/batch/cards.csv
create a card called $id, edition 1 of 100.
use the studded bezel style.

on the front.
use $studded-finish.
print $photo in the window, focused at 0.5 0.2.
spray the window with gloss.
write "fancard" called wordmark in Bodoni Moda italic, at 620 230, size 58.
sign $name at 620 1478.
use $gild on the wordmark and the signature.
